    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lingo follow-ups + number health\nEvery 15 min: chats quiet for the seller's hours (default 5), once each, inside WhatsApp's 24 h window and the seller's sending hours (default 08:00–21:00): confirmed → delivery reminder · cancelled → ask why · no order → \"want to order?\" + 🛒.\nEvery 6 h: each number's token, status and quality rating.\nSame credentials and SUPABASE_URL as the main Lingo workflow.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 1000,
        "color": 6
      },
